.TH JAEGER-CTL 1 "2026-09-06" "zdots" "zdots manual"
.SH NAME
jaeger-ctl \- Service Lifecycle:
.SH SYNOPSIS
See OPTIONS below (generated from \fBjaeger-ctl --help\fR).
.SH OPTIONS
.nf
Usage: jaeger-ctl <command> [--json]

Service Lifecycle:
  install   Download + sha-verify the pinned binary and register launchd
  start     Load and start the launchd service
  stop      Unload and stop the service
  restart   stop then start
  status    Show service state and process info
  health    Exit 0 if the Jaeger UI endpoint is reachable, else 1
  logs      Tail the Jaeger log
  config    Show endpoints and paths

Internal:
  serve     launchd target — binds loopback + execs binary (not for direct use)

Endpoints:
  UI             : http://127.0.0.1:16686 (or https://jaeger.localhost)
  OTLP gRPC      : 127.0.0.1:14317
  OTLP HTTP      : http://127.0.0.1:14318
  Admin / Health : http://127.0.0.1:14269
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
agent-guide(1), zdots-doctor(1)
